<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 / 现状盘点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>AI 改题：逐步状态与证据字段</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#E8A33D' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>部分实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={620} height={400} viewBox='0 0 620 400'><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='400' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='0' y='26' width='620' height='14' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='16' y='26' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>StudyAgent</text><rect x='18' y='58' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>题目：已知函数 f(x) = x³ − 3x，求单调区间</text><rect x='18' y='92' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='124' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>步骤 1 求导 f′(x)=3x²−3 —— 状态 correct</text><rect x='18' y='152' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='184' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>步骤 2 解 f′(x)=0 得 x=±1 —— 状态 partial</text><rect x='18' y='212' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='244' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>步骤 3 列表判断单调性 —— 状态 missing</text><rect x='18' y='272' width='584' height='28' rx='14' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='30' y='291' font-size='14' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>answer_evidence：引用学生作答原文片段</text><rect x='18' y='308' width='584' height='34' rx='17' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='310.0' y='331' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>查看错因与置信度</text><text x='608' y='390' font-size='12' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='end' font-weight='400'>示意占位 · S02</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>界面要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>逐步状态四种：correct / partial / missing / not_applicable，并附 answer_evidence、错因、原因置信度、批改置信度。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>提示词硬要求：步骤缺失不能直接推断为知识或思路错误；原因不明保留未知；不同思路独立判断数学正确性。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>选择题 / 多选题 / 填空题主要走答案匹配路径，不提供逐步 AI 诊断。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>边界：字段齐全不等于已经完全避免 AI 猜测。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ marginTop: 6, padding: '9px 14px', background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 6, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>示意占位 S02 · 待替换为实际截图</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：当前实现能力与名词数量.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 16 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>